{"id":69623,"date":"2025-10-25T08:50:27","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T07:50:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69623"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:25:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:25:47","slug":"cross-dos-cavaleiros-de-vale-santiago","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cross-dos-cavaleiros-de-vale-santiago\/","title":{"rendered":"31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago \/ 17\u00ba Percurso dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago \/ 17\u00ba Percurso dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago \/ 17\u00ba Percurso dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), junto ao <strong>Campo de Futebol de Vale de Santiago<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Odemira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Beja<\/strong>. O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com o <strong>17\u00ba Percurso Pedestre dos Cavaleiros<\/strong> (nas dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>5 km<\/strong> e <strong>10 km<\/strong>), seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> o Cross Masculino de Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos (<strong>7.450 m<\/strong>), \u00e0s <strong>10:45<\/strong> o Cross Feminino de Juniores, Seniores e Veteranas (<strong>5.450 m<\/strong>) e, entre as <strong>11:20 e as 12:15<\/strong>, as provas dos escal\u00f5es jovens de forma\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">As corridas de corta-mato disputam-se em sistema de circuito fechado sobre piso de terra batida, estruturado em tr\u00eas per\u00edmetros: Volta Pequena de <strong>500 m<\/strong> (Benjamins A e B), Volta M\u00e9dia de <strong>1.450 m<\/strong> (Infantis e Juvenis) e Volta Grande de <strong>2.000 m<\/strong> (Iniciados, Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos). A competi\u00e7\u00e3o atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros da Geral Masculina e Feminina (150 \u20ac, 100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 25 \u20ac), aos tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o S\u00e9nior e Veterano (50 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac) e \u00e0s tr\u00eas melhores equipas da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o coletiva (75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 25 \u20ac mais trof\u00e9u at\u00e9 \u00e0 5\u00aa equipa).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>N\u00facleo Desportivo e Cultural de Odemira (NDCO)<\/strong>, em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Odemira e a Freguesia de Vale de Santiago e com o apoio t\u00e9cnico do Conselho Regional de Arbitragem da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja (AAB)<\/strong>, o evento tem secretariado aberto a partir das <strong>08:30<\/strong> no Campo de Futebol de Vale de Santiago. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a <strong>23 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (sendo gratuitas para Benjamins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis e de 8,00 \u20ac para os restantes escal\u00f5es e Percurso Pedestre) e incluem t-shirt oficial, dorsal, produtos alimentares, abastecimentos, medalha <em>finisher<\/em> e banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do campo de futebol.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; f