order: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 23\/11\/2026 (Escal\u00f5es Jovens):<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cross Benjamins A M\/F (Nascidos 2017\/2018\/2019 \u2013 1 Volta Pequena)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 12:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 23\/11\/2026 (Escal\u00f5es Jovens):<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local e programa hor\u00e1rio do 31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, no Campo de Futebol de Vale de Santiago (Odemira, Beja), com secretariado aberto a partir das 08:30. O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:30 com o 17\u00ba Percurso Pedestre (5 km e 10 km), seguido pelo Cross Juniores\/Seniores\/Veteranos Masculinos \u00e0s 10:00 (7.450 m), Cross Juniores\/Seniores\/Veteranas Femininas \u00e0s 10:45 (5.450 m), Juvenis M\/F \u00e0s 11:20 (2.900 m), Iniciados M\/F \u00e0s 11:40 (2.000 m), Infantis M\/F \u00e0s 11:55 (1.450 m), Benjamins B M\/F \u00e0s 12:05 (950 m) e Benjamins A M\/F \u00e0s 12:15 (500 m).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e o prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e respetivos pagamentos devem ser conclu\u00eddos at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de segunda-feira, 23 de novembro de 2026 (n\u00e3o sendo permitidas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es nem altera\u00e7\u00f5es de escal\u00e3o no dia da prova). A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita para todos os escal\u00f5es jovens (Benjamins A e B, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis) e tem o custo de 8,00 \u20ac para Juniores, Seniores, Veteranos e participantes no Percurso Pedestre de 5 km ou 10 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e que apoios existem no local?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt oficial da prova, dorsal (os atletas devem levar alfinetes\/pregadeiras), diversos produtos alimentares, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos, medalha finisher para todos os atletas que concluam a prova e acesso a WC e duches nos balne\u00e1rios do Campo de Futebol de Vale de Santiago.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral por equipas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">H\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 5 primeiros da Geral Individual Masculina e Feminina (150 \u20ac, 100 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 25 \u20ac) e para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o de Seniores M\/F, Veteranas A\/B\/C e Veteranos 1 a 7 (50 \u20ac, 30 \u20ac e 20 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us do 1\u00ba ao 3\u00ba e medalh\u00f5es ao 4\u00ba e 5\u00ba de cada escal\u00e3o. Na Geral por Equipas (que soma os pontos de todos os escal\u00f5es, de 10 pontos para o 1\u00ba at\u00e9 1 ponto para o 10\u00ba), as 3 melhores equipas recebem 75 \u20ac, 50 \u20ac e 25 \u20ac mais trof\u00e9u (e trof\u00e9u para a 4\u00aa e 5\u00aa equipas).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o 31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale de Santiago?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo N\u00facleo Desportivo e Cultural de Odemira (NDCO), em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Odemira e a Freguesia de Vale de Santiago, contando com arbitragem e apoio t\u00e9cnico da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Beja e assist\u00eancia dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Odemira.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago \/ 17\u00ba Percurso dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Odemira, Beja\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Odemira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Beja\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 31\u00ba Cross dos Cavaleiros de Vale Santiago 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro em Vale de Santiago (Odemira). Provas de corta-mato e Percurso Pedestre 5 e 10 km!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-cross-dos-cavaleiros-de-vale-santiago.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"17\u00ba Percurso Pedestre dos Cavaleiros (Longo 10 km \/ M\u00e9dio 5